**Your role, your impact**
As an Oracle Fusion HCM AI Solutions Lead / Senior Consultant, you’ll help drive and expand Oracle AI capabilities within the Oracle HCM Practice by designing innovative AI-driven HCM solutions and enabling enterprise AI adoption. You’ll work closely with business, functional, and technical teams to identify automation opportunities, develop AI-powered use cases, and support customer Oracle AI transformation initiatives. Your expertise in Oracle Fusion AI Agents, AI orchestration, LLM ecosystems, and conversational AI will play a key role in shaping next-generation Oracle HCM solutions while mentoring teams and contributing to practice growth.




**Your day-to-day**

* Design and develop AI-driven use cases and solutions for Oracle Fusion HCM;
* Configure and develop Oracle Fusion AI Agents using Oracle AI Agent Studio;
* Identify AI and automation opportunities within HCM processes in collaboration with stakeholders;
* Design conversational AI solutions, AI-assisted workflows, and enterprise AI integrations;
* Support client demos, workshops, AI strategy discussions, and pre-sales activities;
* Build reusable AI accelerators, frameworks, prototypes, and demo use cases for the Oracle HCM Practice;
* Mentor teams on Oracle Fusion AI capabilities, enterprise adoption, and best practices;
* Stay current on Oracle AI roadmap, LLM advancements, and enterprise AI trends;
* Contribute to innovation initiatives and the AI capability roadmap within the practice.



**Keys to your success**

* 7+ years of experience within the Oracle Fusion HCM ecosystem, with strong exposure to Oracle Fusion AI capabilities;
* Hands-on experience with Oracle Fusion AI Agents and Oracle AI Agent Studio;
* Strong understanding of enterprise AI concepts including LLMs, prompt engineering, AI orchestration, conversational AI, and responsible AI;
* Experience designing AI-driven solutions, copilots, assistants, or intelligent automation;
* Good understanding of integration patterns between Oracle Fusion HCM and external AI platforms/tools;
* Strong communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills;
* Experience supporting demos, workshops, and pre-sales activities;
* Ability to mentor teams and contribute to AI capability development.

**Extra edge**

* Oracle Fusion AI or AI platform certifications;
* Experience with enterprise AI ecosystems (Microsoft Copilot, OpenAI / Azure OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, Microsoft 365 AI);
* Exposure to AI architecture, security, and governance frameworks.

**Language Skills**

* English: Proficient



**Our mission, your future**
As a global network of trusted advisors, we create cutting-edge technological solutions to overcome today’s challenges and anticipate tomorrow’s needs. It all starts with the collaboration of a diverse team of passionate innovators, each driven to make a difference. Together, we challenge the status quo and push each other to new heights.


Ready to leave your mark on engaging mandates and shape the future through digital transformation and strategic consulting? Take your ambitions to the next level and discover your next exciting challenge with us!




**Our offer**

* Global collaboration: Partner directly with our North American teams on projects for clients in high-impact industries, gaining the kind of cross-border exposure that sharpens your expertise and expands your horizons.
* Continuous growth and learning: Unlimited access to online learning, plus certification paths, including through our Microsoft, Oracle, and Salesforce partnerships, so your expertise keeps pace with the technology you work on.
* Flexible work options: Work arrangements that support your rhythm and your reality.
* Support for your well-being: Comprehensive insurance plan to support you and your family, with premiums fully paid by us.

**Our commitments**

* Our authenticity is our strength: The diversity of our backgrounds, experiences, thoughts and insights is our competitive advantage. We foster a collaborative environment where we embrace our authenticity and leverage our unique perspectives to collectively build the future we all envision.
* An inclusive path to success: Fostering an environment where you can thrive starts with ensuring an accessible recruitment process. If you require any accommodations, we welcome you to contact us. For more information, please visit our accessibility page: https://www.alithya.com/en/accessibility .
